{"id":"forecast-16","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-16/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":343.17,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.0,"text":"IELTS Listening. The test is in four parts. Write all your answers in the listening question","words":[["IELTS",0.0,0.26],["Listening.",0.26,0.62],["The",1.38,2.06],["test",2.06,2.48],["is",2.48,3.06],["in",3.06,3.18],["four",3.18,3.56],["parts.",3.56,4.1],["Write",5.18,5.46],["all",5.46,5.76],["your",5.76,5.94],["answers",5.94,6.36],["in",6.36,6.98],["the",6.98,7.12],["listening",7.12,7.5],["question",7.5,8.0]]},{"start":8.0,"end":14.12,"text":"booklet. At the end of the test, you'll be given ten minutes to transfer your answers","words":[["booklet.",8.0,8.48],["At",9.58,9.82],["the",9.82,9.92],["end",9.92,10.12],["of",10.12,10.24],["the",10.24,10.32],["test,",10.32,10.66],["you'll",11.12,11.48],["be",11.48,11.62],["given",11.62,11.92],["ten",11.92,12.26],["minutes",12.26,12.68],["to",12.68,12.94],["transfer",12.94,13.48],["your",13.48,13.72],["answers",13.72,14.12]]},{"start":14.12,"end":21.4,"text":"to an answer sheet. Now turned to part one, on page two of your question booklet.","words":[["to",14.12,14.42],["an",14.42,14.6],["answer",14.6,14.9],["sheet.",14.9,15.26],["Now",17.22,17.66],["turned",17.66,17.98],["to",17.98,18.14],["part",18.14,18.3],["one,",18.3,18.74],["on",19.22,19.5],["page",19.5,19.82],["two",19.82,20.3],["of",20.3,20.5],["your",20.5,20.64],["question",20.64,20.94],["booklet.",20.94,21.4]]},{"start":26.55,"end":32.55,"text":"Part one. You will hear a conversation between a man enrolling at a medical center and","words":[["Part",26.55,26.85],["one.",26.85,27.21],["You",27.95,28.29],["will",28.29,28.47],["hear",28.47,28.67],["a",28.67,28.89],["conversation",28.89,29.57],["between",29.57,29.99],["a",29.99,30.29],["man",30.29,30.49],["enrolling",30.49,31.05],["at",31.05,31.29],["a",31.29,31.43],["medical",31.43,31.67],["center",31.67,32.11],["and",32.11,32.55]]},{"start":32.55,"end":69.0,"text":"receptionist. First you have some time to look at questions one to six. Now listen","words":[["receptionist.",32.55,33.39],["First",34.13,34.71],["you",34.71,35.15],["have",35.15,35.29],["some",35.29,35.47],["time",35.47,35.75],["to",35.75,35.91],["look",35.91,36.07],["at",36.07,36.25],["questions",36.25,36.61],["one",36.61,37.13],["to",37.13,37.45],["six.",37.45,37.83],["Now",68.14,68.66],["listen",68.66,69.0]]},{"start":69.0,"end":77.57,"text":"carefully and answer questions one to six. Good morning sir how can I help you?","words":[["carefully",69.0,69.5],["and",69.5,70.02],["answer",70.02,70.44],["questions",70.44,70.9],["one",70.9,71.48],["to",71.48,71.8],["six.",71.8,72.22],["Good",75.59,75.91],["morning",75.91,76.15],["sir",76.15,76.47],["how",76.47,76.89],["can",76.89,77.05],["I",77.05,77.13],["help",77.13,77.33],["you?",77.33,77.57]]},{"start":78.17,"end":82.23,"text":"Hello there. Well I've just moved to this city and so I'd like to register as a","words":[["Hello",78.17,78.45],["there.",78.45,78.69],["Well",79.13,79.35],["I've",79.35,79.47],["just",79.47,79.61],["moved",79.61,79.81],["to",79.81,79.95],["this",79.95,80.09],["city",80.09,80.37],["and",80.37,80.97],["so",80.97,81.13],["I'd",81.13,81.29],["like",81.29,81.39],["to",81.39,81.55],["register",81.55,81.91],["as",81.91,82.13],["a",82.13,82.23]]},{"start":82.23,"end":88.67,"text":"new patient here. Sure I'll just get the right form. Now first could I have a","words":[["new",82.23,82.35],["patient",82.35,82.69],["here.",82.69,83.01],["Sure",83.27,83.55],["I'll",83.55,84.13],["just",84.13,84.31],["get",84.31,84.47],["the",84.47,84.59],["right",84.59,84.77],["form.",84.77,85.09],["Now",86.13,86.65],["first",86.65,87.71],["could",87.71,88.05],["I",88.05,88.33],["have",88.33,88.57],["a",88.57,88.67]]},{"start":88.67,"end":93.55,"text":"name please? Yes my first name is Henry my middle name","words":[["name",88.67,88.87],["please?",88.87,89.19],["Yes",90.03,90.49],["my",90.49,91.29],["first",91.29,91.65],["name",91.65,91.91],["is",91.91,92.05],["Henry",92.05,92.35],["my",92.35,93.05],["middle",93.05,93.27],["name",93.27,93.55]]},{"start":93.55,"end":101.87,"text":"as Ian, and the family name is Prestony. P-R-E-S-T-N-E-Y.","words":[["as",93.55,93.73],["Ian,",93.73,93.91],["and",94.39,94.59],["the",94.59,94.71],["family",94.71,94.95],["name",94.95,95.23],["is",95.23,95.43],["Prestony.",95.43,96.21],["P",96.73,96.99],["-R",96.99,97.63],["-E",97.63,98.21],["-S",98.21,99.03],["-T",99.03,99.53],["-N",99.53,100.37],["-E",100.37,101.09],["-Y.",101.09,101.87]]},{"start":102.25,"end":104.41,"text":"Right. And a date of birth?","words":[["Right.",102.25,102.61],["And",103.27,103.67],["a",103.67,103.85],["date",103.85,104.01],["of",104.01,104.15],["birth?",104.15,104.41]]},{"start":105.01,"end":107.13,"text":"It's the 17th of March, 1965.","words":[["It's",105.01,105.41],["the",105.41,105.51],["17th",105.51,106.07],["of",106.07,106.17],["March,",106.17,106.43],["1965.",106.65,107.13]]},{"start":107.95,"end":110.23,"text":"Great. And your address, please?","words":[["Great.",107.95,108.23],["And",108.81,109.27],["your",109.27,109.55],["address,",109.55,109.95],["please?",110.07,110.23]]},{"start":110.93,"end":117.57,"text":"52. Oh no, that was my old house. My address here is number 34, Market Road.","words":[["52.",110.93,111.53],["Oh",112.27,112.45],["no,",112.45,112.85],["that",112.95,113.03],["was",113.03,113.35],["my",113.35,113.53],["old",113.53,113.67],["house.",113.67,113.93],["My",114.73,115.03],["address",115.03,115.25],["here",115.25,115.53],["is",115.53,115.67],["number",115.67,115.87],["34,",115.87,116.55],["Market",116.91,117.13],["Road.",117.13,117.57]]},{"start":118.05,"end":120.83,"text":"Right. Could I have your home number, sir?","words":[["Right.",118.05,118.41],["Could",119.13,119.43],["I",119.43,119.59],["have",119.59,119.77],["your",119.77,119.95],["home",119.95,120.29],["number,",120.29,120.61],["sir?",120.71,120.83]]},{"start":120.83,"end":129.61,"text":"Um, let me remember it. I haven't learned it yet. Two, eight, four. Sorry. Two, nine,","words":[["Um,",120.83,121.79],["let",122.43,122.75],["me",122.75,122.89],["remember",122.89,123.37],["it.",123.37,123.63],["I",124.07,124.25],["haven't",124.25,124.51],["learned",124.51,124.75],["it",124.75,124.91],["yet.",124.91,125.13],["Two,",125.93,126.29],["eight,",126.55,126.73],["four.",126.95,127.45],["Sorry.",127.93,128.31],["Two,",128.93,129.27],["nine,",129.35,129.61]]},{"start":129.79,"end":134.77,"text":"three, eight, four, seven, six. Yes, that's it. I've just had the phone connected.","words":[["three,",129.79,130.11],["eight,",130.55,130.77],["four,",130.99,131.13],["seven,",131.25,131.51],["six.",131.63,131.85],["Yes,",132.25,132.51],["that's",132.59,132.83],["it.",132.83,132.93],["I've",133.47,133.73],["just",133.73,133.89],["had",133.89,134.07],["the",134.07,134.17],["phone",134.17,134.35],["connected.",134.35,134.77]]},{"start":135.17,"end":141.29,"text":"Alrighty. Well, that's the contact details finished. Now, I need some other bits of information,","words":[["Alrighty.",135.17,135.67],["Well,",136.23,136.47],["that's",136.59,136.93],["the",136.93,137.05],["contact",137.05,137.37],["details",137.37,137.87],["finished.",137.87,138.25],["Now,",138.99,139.23],["I",139.39,139.55],["need",139.55,139.83],["some",139.83,140.07],["other",140.07,140.37],["bits",140.37,140.63],["of",140.63,140.77],["information,",140.77,141.29]]},{"start":141.47,"end":148.11,"text":"if you don't mind. First, I need to ask you which ethnic group do you most identify","words":[["if",141.47,141.67],["you",141.67,141.75],["don't",141.75,141.89],["mind.",141.89,142.13],["First,",142.83,143.25],["I",143.79,144.19],["need",144.19,144.77],["to",144.77,144.95],["ask",144.95,145.25],["you",145.25,145.57],["which",145.57,146.27],["ethnic",146.27,146.77],["group",146.77,147.13],["do",147.13,147.29],["you",147.29,147.37],["most",147.37,147.53],["identify",147.53,148.11]]},{"start":148.11,"end":155.33,"text":"with out of New Zealand Māori, Cook Island Māori, European, Tongan or Samoan.","words":[["with",148.11,148.41],["out",148.41,148.91],["of",148.91,149.33],["New",149.33,149.81],["Zealand",149.81,150.17],["Māori,",150.17,150.59],["Cook",151.11,151.43],["Island",151.43,151.71],["Māori,",151.71,152.19],["European,",152.77,153.23],["Tongan",154.17,154.51],["or",154.51,154.81],["Samoan.",154.81,155.33]]},{"start":155.93,"end":156.57,"text":"European?","words":[["European?",155.93,156.57]]},{"start":157.51,"end":164.37,"text":"Right, thanks. That's just for statistical purposes. You know, we have to gather that info for the Ministry of Health.","words":[["Right,",157.51,157.83],["thanks.",158.01,158.27],["That's",158.69,159.07],["just",159.07,159.33],["for",159.33,159.61],["statistical",159.61,160.15],["purposes.",160.15,160.71],["You",161.17,161.17],["know,",161.17,161.25],["we",161.39,161.75],["have",161.75,161.93],["to",161.93,162.07],["gather",162.07,162.57],["that",162.57,162.83],["info",162.83,163.29],["for",163.29,163.53],["the",163.53,163.63],["Ministry",163.63,163.91],["of",163.91,164.09],["Health.",164.09,164.37]]},{"start":165.21,"end":166.93,"text":"And are you a New Zealand citizen?","words":[["And",165.21,165.65],["are",165.65,165.99],["you",165.99,166.19],["a",166.19,166.29],["New",166.29,166.39],["Zealand",166.39,166.67],["citizen?",166.67,166.93]]},{"start":167.51,"end":168.33,"text":"Yes, I am.","words":[["Yes,",167.51,167.79],["I",167.95,168.13],["am.",168.13,168.33]]},{"start":168.61,"end":174.37,"text":"Alright, I'll put that down. That's good. So you qualify for subsidised health care.","words":[["Alright,",168.61,168.97],["I'll",169.39,169.65],["put",169.65,169.83],["that",169.83,170.03],["down.",170.03,170.31],["That's",170.89,171.29],["good.",171.29,171.47],["So",171.87,172.15],["you",172.15,172.45],["qualify",172.45,172.89],["for",172.89,173.21],["subsidised",173.21,173.81],["health",173.81,174.01],["care.",174.01,174.37]]},{"start":175.01,"end":181.67,"text":"And now, do you hold any special cards such as a high user card or a low income card?","words":[["And",175.01,175.61],["now,",175.61,176.01],["do",176.17,176.31],["you",176.31,176.49],["hold",176.49,176.85],["any",176.85,177.15],["special",177.15,177.57],["cards",177.57,178.07],["such",178.07,178.77],["as",178.77,179.09],["a",179.09,179.23],["high",179.23,179.43],["user",179.43,179.73],["card",179.73,180.07],["or",180.07,180.49],["a",180.49,180.69],["low",180.69,180.87],["income",180.87,181.21],["card?",181.21,181.67]]},{"start":181.99,"end":188.21,"text":"Yes, actually, I am a high user. I've had a lot of trouble with my back over the last 10 years.","words":[["Yes,",181.99,182.51],["actually,",182.67,183.05],["I",183.23,183.63],["am",183.63,183.79],["a",183.79,183.89],["high",183.89,184.09],["user.",184.09,184.43],["I've",184.93,185.35],["had",185.35,185.45],["a",185.45,185.55],["lot",185.55,185.67],["of",185.67,185.77],["trouble",185.77,186.03],["with",186.03,186.21],["my",186.21,186.39],["back",186.39,186.71],["over",186.71,187.21],["the",187.21,187.33],["last",187.33,187.61],["10",187.61,187.87],["years.",187.87,188.21]]},{"start":188.69,"end":193.03,"text":"Fine. I'll write that down for our records here so that you'll get that discount.","words":[["Fine.",188.69,189.13],["I'll",189.65,189.89],["write",189.89,190.05],["that",190.05,190.23],["down",190.23,190.45],["for",190.45,190.61],["our",190.61,190.75],["records",190.75,191.11],["here",191.11,191.43],["so",191.43,191.97],["that",191.97,192.15],["you'll",192.15,192.31],["get",192.31,192.43],["that",192.43,192.61],["discount.",192.61,193.03]]},{"start":196.59,"end":202.21,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 7 to 10.","words":[["Before",196.59,197.09],["you",197.09,197.35],["hear",197.35,197.57],["the",197.57,197.71],["rest",197.71,197.93],["of",197.93,198.07],["the",198.07,198.19],["conversation,",198.19,198.77],["you",199.23,199.43],["have",199.43,199.57],["some",199.57,199.73],["time",199.73,200.01],["to",200.01,200.21],["look",200.21,200.37],["at",200.37,200.57],["questions",200.57,200.87],["7",200.87,201.47],["to",201.47,201.87],["10.",201.87,202.21]]},{"start":222.46,"end":225.74,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 7 to 10.","words":[["Now",222.46,222.74],["listen",222.74,223.1],["and",223.1,223.52],["answer",223.52,223.92],["questions",223.92,224.34],["7",224.34,225.02],["to",225.02,225.36],["10.",225.36,225.74]]},{"start":225.74,"end":234.1,"text":"And now, so that we can apply to have your medical records transferred here, can you tell","words":[["And",225.74,226.52],["now,",229.36,229.68],["so",229.98,230.26],["that",230.26,230.44],["we",230.44,230.56],["can",230.56,230.72],["apply",230.72,231.0],["to",231.0,231.14],["have",231.14,231.3],["your",231.3,231.42],["medical",231.42,231.78],["records",231.78,232.26],["transferred",232.26,232.76],["here,",232.76,233.16],["can",233.56,233.76],["you",233.76,233.92],["tell",233.92,234.1]]},{"start":234.1,"end":235.86,"text":"me the name of your previous health centre?","words":[["me",234.1,234.22],["the",234.22,234.34],["name",234.34,234.58],["of",234.58,234.72],["your",234.72,234.88],["previous",234.88,235.22],["health",235.22,235.52],["centre?",235.52,235.86]]},{"start":236.22,"end":238.36,"text":"Yes, it was called Castle Hill.","words":[["Yes,",236.22,236.5],["it",236.92,237.12],["was",237.12,237.24],["called",237.24,237.6],["Castle",237.6,238.0],["Hill.",238.0,238.36]]},{"start":238.82,"end":243.56,"text":"Okay, I haven't heard of that practice before, so it can't be on Stewart Island or I'd","words":[["Okay,",238.82,239.16],["I",239.66,239.98],["haven't",239.98,240.18],["heard",240.18,240.4],["of",240.4,240.54],["that",240.54,240.68],["practice",240.68,241.0],["before,",241.0,241.36],["so",241.36,241.7],["it",241.7,242.0],["can't",242.0,242.3],["be",242.3,242.42],["on",242.42,242.54],["Stewart",242.54,242.84],["Island",242.84,243.16],["or",243.16,243.38],["I'd",243.38,243.56]]},{"start":243.56,"end":248.76,"text":"know it. And you don't sound like a Southlander anyway. So is it the North Island you've","words":[["know",243.56,243.74],["it.",243.74,244.0],["And",244.6,244.76],["you",244.76,244.92],["don't",244.92,245.24],["sound",245.24,245.56],["like",245.56,245.78],["a",245.78,245.94],["Southlander",245.94,246.46],["anyway.",246.46,246.68],["So",247.34,247.6],["is",247.6,247.86],["it",247.86,247.96],["the",247.96,248.08],["North",248.08,248.26],["Island",248.26,248.54],["you've",248.54,248.76]]},{"start":248.76,"end":249.14,"text":"come from?","words":[["come",248.76,248.94],["from?",248.94,249.14]]},{"start":249.22,"end":250.38,"text":"Yes, you're quite right.","words":[["Yes,",249.22,249.54],["you're",249.72,249.88],["quite",249.88,250.1],["right.",250.1,250.38]]},{"start":250.58,"end":255.64,"text":"Okay. Well, I'll get you to sign this release form here, which gives us permission","words":[["Okay.",250.58,251.0],["Well,",251.62,252.06],["I'll",252.24,252.4],["get",252.4,252.56],["you",252.56,252.74],["to",252.74,252.86],["sign",252.86,253.08],["this",253.08,253.34],["release",253.34,253.72],["form",253.72,254.04],["here,",254.04,254.3],["which",254.3,254.82],["gives",254.82,255.04],["us",255.04,255.24],["permission",255.24,255.64]]},{"start":255.64,"end":260.52,"text":"to request the transfer of your file and then I can write to them and have your record sent to us.","words":[["to",255.64,255.88],["request",255.88,256.22],["the",256.22,256.44],["transfer",256.44,256.8],["of",256.8,257.0],["your",257.0,257.12],["file",257.12,257.5],["and",257.5,258.12],["then",258.12,258.3],["I",258.3,258.52],["can",258.52,258.68],["write",258.68,258.86],["to",258.86,259.06],["them",259.06,259.2],["and",259.2,259.3],["have",259.3,259.46],["your",259.46,259.6],["record",259.6,259.9],["sent",259.9,260.14],["to",260.14,260.36],["us.",260.36,260.52]]},{"start":261.04,"end":262.64,"text":"Thank you. That'll be good.","words":[["Thank",261.04,261.32],["you.",261.32,261.54],["That'll",262.1,262.34],["be",262.34,262.42],["good.",262.42,262.64]]},{"start":262.92,"end":265.58,"text":"Yes. It only takes a week or so to arrive usually.","words":[["Yes.",262.92,263.16],["It",263.54,263.7],["only",263.7,263.88],["takes",263.88,264.16],["a",264.16,264.34],["week",264.34,264.46],["or",264.46,264.62],["so",264.62,264.8],["to",264.8,264.94],["arrive",264.94,265.26],["usually.",265.26,265.58]]},{"start":266.54,"end":269.14,"text":"Now, let's think about a doctor for you.","words":[["Now,",266.54,266.98],["let's",267.1,267.38],["think",267.38,267.58],["about",267.58,267.88],["a",267.88,268.06],["doctor",268.06,268.4],["for",268.4,268.84],["you.",268.84,269.14]]},{"start":269.54,"end":272.42,"text":"There are six doctors at the centre, so you have a choice.","words":[["There",269.54,269.78],["are",269.78,269.96],["six",269.96,270.28],["doctors",270.28,270.64],["at",270.64,270.84],["the",270.84,270.96],["centre,",270.96,271.24],["so",271.52,271.8],["you",271.8,271.94],["have",271.94,272.1],["a",272.1,272.18],["choice.",272.18,272.42]]},{"start":273.14,"end":275.68,"text":"Do you want to enrol with any particular one of them?","words":[["Do",273.14,273.32],["you",273.32,273.5],["want",273.5,273.7],["to",273.7,273.92],["enrol",273.92,274.2],["with",274.2,274.42],["any",274.42,274.7],["particular",274.7,275.1],["one",275.1,275.36],["of",275.36,275.52],["them?",275.52,275.68]]},{"start":276.08,"end":280.5,"text":"Well, no, not really. Being you here, I don't know any of them,","words":[["Well,",276.08,276.4],["no,",276.56,277.34],["not",277.52,277.68],["really.",277.68,278.02],["Being",278.52,278.84],["you",278.84,279.1],["here,",279.1,279.32],["I",279.42,279.5],["don't",279.5,279.72],["know",279.72,279.98],["any",279.98,280.14],["of",280.14,280.3],["them,",280.3,280.5]]},{"start":280.54,"end":281.8,"text":"so it doesn't really matter.","words":[["so",280.54,280.9],["it",280.9,281.02],["doesn't",281.02,281.28],["really",281.28,281.48],["matter.",281.48,281.8]]},{"start":282.5,"end":285.58,"text":"I'd rather not have a female doctor though, if that's possible.","words":[["I'd",282.5,282.98],["rather",282.98,283.18],["not",283.18,283.34],["have",283.34,283.54],["a",283.54,283.64],["female",283.64,283.96],["doctor",283.96,284.34],["though,",284.34,284.7],["if",284.8,284.9],["that's",284.9,285.16],["possible.",285.16,285.58]]},{"start":285.74,"end":294.76,"text":"That's fine. I'll put down mail. That gives you three options, but some of those doctors only work part-time hours here, so would that be okay with you?","words":[["That's",285.74,286.04],["fine.",286.04,286.38],["I'll",286.78,286.92],["put",286.92,287.1],["down",287.1,287.34],["mail.",287.34,287.66],["That",288.34,288.66],["gives",288.66,288.92],["you",288.92,289.16],["three",289.16,289.5],["options,",289.5,290.0],["but",290.32,290.48],["some",290.48,290.86],["of",290.86,290.96],["those",290.96,291.14],["doctors",291.14,291.42],["only",291.42,291.88],["work",291.88,292.1],["part",292.1,292.36],["-time",292.36,292.66],["hours",292.66,293.08],["here,",293.08,293.32],["so",293.38,293.56],["would",293.56,293.8],["that",293.8,293.94],["be",293.94,294.08],["okay",294.08,294.36],["with",294.36,294.6],["you?",294.6,294.76]]},{"start":295.0,"end":306.8,"text":"Oh, I see. Well, since I do have a chronic problem, which is why I hold the card we were talking about earlier, I would prefer seeing someone who'd not be hard to get hold of at any time.","words":[["Oh,",295.0,295.36],["I",295.4,295.52],["see.",295.52,295.84],["Well,",296.76,297.12],["since",297.42,297.88],["I",297.88,298.12],["do",298.12,298.26],["have",298.26,298.44],["a",298.44,298.54],["chronic",298.54,298.82],["problem,",298.82,299.28],["which",299.7,299.86],["is",299.86,299.98],["why",299.98,300.22],["I",300.22,300.4],["hold",300.4,300.6],["the",300.6,300.76],["card",300.76,301.1],["we",301.1,301.28],["were",301.28,301.4],["talking",301.4,301.6],["about",301.6,301.9],["earlier,",301.9,302.24],["I",302.82,303.02],["would",303.02,303.22],["prefer",303.22,303.64],["seeing",303.64,304.1],["someone",304.1,304.44],["who'd",304.44,304.76],["not",304.76,304.96],["be",304.96,305.16],["hard",305.16,305.46],["to",305.46,305.6],["get",305.6,305.72],["hold",305.72,305.96],["of",305.96,306.12],["at",306.12,306.2],["any",306.2,306.36],["time.",306.36,306.8]]},{"start":306.8,"end":313.12,"text":"So, you want a full-time doctor? I'll write that here. That is no problem, sir. Any other preferences?","words":[["So,",306.8,307.34],["you",307.56,307.66],["want",307.66,307.88],["a",307.88,308.0],["full",308.0,308.3],["-time",308.3,308.58],["doctor?",308.58,308.9],["I'll",309.22,309.4],["write",309.4,309.62],["that",309.62,309.8],["here.",309.8,310.06],["That",310.74,310.96],["is",310.96,311.12],["no",311.12,311.3],["problem,",311.3,311.62],["sir.",311.68,311.9],["Any",312.4,312.58],["other",312.58,312.78],["preferences?",312.78,313.12]]},{"start":313.7,"end":320.42,"text":"Yes. My back is actually an old injury from playing rugby, so I'd like to see a sports specialist, if possible.","words":[["Yes.",313.7,314.08],["My",314.8,315.06],["back",315.06,315.22],["is",315.22,315.4],["actually",315.4,315.7],["an",315.7,315.88],["old",315.88,316.04],["injury",316.04,316.4],["from",316.4,316.64],["playing",316.64,316.9],["rugby,",316.9,317.22],["so",317.54,318.12],["I'd",318.12,318.32],["like",318.32,318.42],["to",318.42,318.58],["see",318.58,318.76],["a",318.76,318.86],["sports",318.86,319.16],["specialist,",319.16,319.78],["if",319.88,319.98],["possible.",319.98,320.42]]},{"start":320.84,"end":326.36,"text":"Well, let's see. I'll assign you to Dr Chang because he specialises in that branch of medicine.","words":[["Well,",320.84,321.14],["let's",321.26,321.62],["see.",321.62,321.9],["I'll",322.08,322.26],["assign",322.26,322.66],["you",322.66,323.02],["to",323.02,323.4],["Dr",323.4,323.76],["Chang",323.76,324.16],["because",324.16,324.5],["he",324.5,324.72],["specialises",324.72,325.4],["in",325.4,325.58],["that",325.58,325.7],["branch",325.7,325.94],["of",325.94,326.14],["medicine.",326.14,326.36]]},{"start":327.38,"end":329.56,"text":"Well, welcome to Dunedin, Mr Presney.","words":[["Well,",327.38,327.68],["welcome",328.0,328.4],["to",328.4,328.54],["Dunedin,",328.54,329.0],["Mr",329.0,329.16],["Presney.",329.16,329.56]]},{"start":329.98,"end":332.96,"text":"Thank you very much for all your help. You've been most kind.","words":[["Thank",329.98,330.3],["you",330.3,330.44],["very",330.44,330.64],["much",330.64,330.88],["for",330.88,331.06],["all",331.06,331.18],["your",331.18,331.3],["help.",331.3,331.6],["You've",332.08,332.26],["been",332.26,332.38],["most",332.38,332.64],["kind.",332.64,332.96]]},{"start":332.96,"end":342.36,"text":"That is the end of part one. You now have one minute to check your answers to part one.","words":[["That",332.96,334.02],["is",336.84,337.06],["the",337.06,337.24],["end",337.24,337.46],["of",337.46,337.62],["part",337.62,337.82],["one.",337.82,338.24],["You",338.82,339.12],["now",339.12,339.36],["have",339.36,339.66],["one",339.66,339.96],["minute",339.96,340.28],["to",340.28,340.6],["check",340.6,340.84],["your",340.84,341.06],["answers",341.06,341.42],["to",341.42,341.72],["part",341.72,341.96],["one.",341.96,342.36]]}]}